{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55018","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 四十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风不起，旗号自飞扬。\n前指敌军幷阵次，必当我胜用心肠，得胜早回乡。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}